<!-- ====================  SERVICES OVERVIEW ==================== -->
<section class="container py-5">
  <div class="text-center mb-5">
    <span class="section-badge"><i class="fas fa-stethoscope me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>What We Offer</span>
    <h2 class="fw-bold">Tertiary Health Care Services</h2>
    <p class="col-lg-7 mx-auto">Hub for Neurosurgery, Joint Replacements, Urology, Oncology, Diabetology, Trauma care apart from routine medical and surgical specialities</p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="row g-4">
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" id="joint">
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-header">
          <div class="service-icon-large"><i class="fas fa-bone"></i></div>
          <h3 class="fw-bold">Joint Replacement</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Knee/shoulder/hip replacement surgery is an orthopedic procedure that replaces a very painful knee/shoulder/hip with a new artificial joint. This surgery is done when joint pain does not stop with painkillers or injections.</p>
        <div class="service-features">
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Knee Replacement</span>
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Hip Replacement</span>
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Shoulder Replacement</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" id="cancer">
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-header">
          <div class="service-icon-large"><i class="fas fa-dna"></i></div>
          <h3 class="fw-bold">Cancer Treatment</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Cancer can be treated by surgery. The choice of treatment depends upon the location and position of the tumor and the stage of the disease, as well as the general state of the patient. A number of experimental cancer treatments are also under growth.</p>
        <div class="service-features">
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Surgical Oncology</span>
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Chemotherapy</span>
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Palliative Care</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" id="heart">
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-header">
          <div class="service-icon-large"><i class="fas fa-heartbeat"></i></div>
          <h3 class="fw-bold">Heart Care</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Cardiac care emergencies like Heart Attack, Heart Failure, Heart Block, Irregular Heart Beats management can be treated. Other facilities like 2D Echo with Color Doppler, Stress Test is available.</p>
        <p class="fw-bold mt-2">State of art - Philips Cathlab where more than 1000 cases successfully done...</p>
        <div class="service-features">
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Angiography</span>
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Angioplasty</span>
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> 2D Echo</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" id="brain">
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-header">
          <div class="service-icon-large"><i class="fas fa-brain"></i></div>
          <h3 class="fw-bold">Brain Disorders</h3>
        </div>
        <p>A neurological disorder is any disorder of the nervous system. There are many recognized neurological disorders, some comparatively common, but many rare. They may be measured by neurological examination, and studied and treated within the specialities of neurology and clinical neuropsychology.</p>
        <div class="service-features">
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Neurosurgery</span>
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Stroke Management</span>
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Epilepsy Care</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" id="renal">
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-header">
          <div class="service-icon-large"><i class="fas fa-kidneys"></i></div>
          <h3 class="fw-bold">Renal Welfare</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Maccare is a familiar retreat of complete medical relief and treatment. The first-time support and spirit of the community has provided the hospital with a strong practice of community service, maintaining standards of excellence and motivated for future sustainability.</p>
        <div class="service-features">
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Dialysis</span>
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Kidney Care</span>
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Urology</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" id="diabetes">
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-header">
          <div class="service-icon-large"><i class="fas fa-droplet"></i></div>
          <h3 class="fw-bold">Sugar Control</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Diabetes commonly referred to as diabetes, is a group of metabolic disorders in which there are high blood sugar levels over a protracted period.</p>
        <div class="service-features">
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Diabetes Management</span>
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Diet Counseling</span>
          <span class="feature-badge"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Insulin Therapy</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

